<!--
id: D01
name: Payment failed
layout: base
kind: campaign
sender: hi
category: billing
topic: none
trigger: event payment_failed (send to unsubscribed people: on)
phase: 2
subject: Payment didn't go through
preheader: Update your payment details to keep your plan active.
footer_reason: You're receiving this because a payment for your Hydrilla plan failed.
optional: false
facts: confirm where people update payment details (billing_url points at the pricing page for now)
data: event.plan_name, event.billing_url
-->
<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>We couldn't take the latest payment for your {{ event.plan_name | default: "Hydrilla" }} plan.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Update your payment details to keep your plan active. If the payment can't be completed, your plan is put on hold and new generations stop until it is.</mj-text>
<mj-button href="{{ event.billing_url | default: 'https://hydrilla.ai/app/pricing' }}">Update payment details</mj-button>
